### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Search only
GET http://localhost:8000/search?q=ручная%20сверка%20платежей%20бизнес&limit=5

### Research: search -> crawl -> LLM -> DB
POST http://localhost:8000/research
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "бизнес вручную сверяет платежи сотрудники автоматизация стоимость процесса",
  "search_limit": 6,
  "crawl_limit": 3
}

### Opportunities
GET http://localhost:8000/opportunities

### Feedback (replace UUID)
POST http://localhost:8000/opportunities/REPLACE_UUID/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "reject",
  "reason": "already_solved_cheaply",
  "correction": {
    "note": "Existing SaaS solves this too cheaply; downgrade competition and opportunity score"
  }
}
